<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Pass@1 accuracy (%) comparison across different methods and datasets. SE and CI denote search engine and code interpreter tool augmentation respectively. Notably, Search-R1 is evaluated using our standardized search engine for fair comparison. The <sup id="Sx4.T1.7" class="ltx_sup">†</sup> symbol indicates datasets from <span id="Sx4.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">TAPO-easy-60K</span>, while <sup id="Sx4.T1.9" class="ltx_sup">∗</sup> denotes datasets from <span id="Sx4.T1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">TAPO-hard-18K</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
