</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Case 2</h3>

<div id="A3.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents two representative examples from the Complex-8K dataset, demonstrating how multi-stage reasoning and reinforcement learning enhances the model’s tool utilization capabilities.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SSx2.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Case 2.1</h4>

<div id="A3.SSx2.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx2.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question: Calculate the length of time between the SpaceX Starship first launch and the Artemis I mission launch. (Unit: days)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SSx2.SSSx1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SSx2.SSSx1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="409.39" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-204.69px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 409.39" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,409.39) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FF6666;" fill="#FF6666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 409.39 L 700 409.39 L 700 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFE6E6;" fill="#FFE6E6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 383.74 L 698.03 383.74 L 698.03 1.97 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFCCCC;" fill="#FFCCCC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 385.71 L 1.97 407.42 L 698.03 407.42 L 698.03 385.71 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 393.1)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="571.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
