<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;response&gt;<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
