<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;think&gt;<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
Based on the provided information, I have the GDP figures for India for the fiscal years 2021 and 2024.
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For 2021:</span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- GDP: 3.167 trillion</span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For 2024:</span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- GDP: 3.91 trillion
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/think&gt;</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;code&gt;<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.15.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>gdp_2021 = 3.167e12 # in USD<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.15.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>gdp_2024 = 3.91e12 # in USD<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.15.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">growth_rate = ((gdp_2024 - gdp_2021) / gdp_2021) * 100<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>print(round(growth_rate, 1))<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.16.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>&lt;/code&gt;<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.16.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;response&gt;<span id="A3.SSx2.SSSx2.p3.pic1.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">23.5 
