<span id="A3.SSx3.SSSx1.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx3.SSSx1.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Doc 2: (Title: Scouting Countries) This is a complete list of the countries where Scouting exists. The asterisks mark countries that have third-party operating agreements with the US.</span></span>
