<span id="A3.SSx3.SSSx1.p2.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx3.SSSx1.p2.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Doc 5: (Title: Scouting in Other Countries 2025 - World Population Review) Just about every country in the world, with a few notable exceptions, has a scouting program. Although there are several scouting programs globally, only about …</span></span>
