<section id="A3.SSx3.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Case 3.2</h4>

<div id="A3.SSx3.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx3.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx3.SSSx2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question: Who has won the CMA entertainer of the year the most?</span></p>
